   "name": "ISPM 15 Export Packing",
   "description": "Export packing to ISPM 15 (International Standards for Phytosanitary Measures No. 15) for international shipping. Wood packaging material over 6 mm thick is treated — heat treatment to a core temperature of at least 56 °C for at least 30 minutes, or an approved fumigation — debarked, and marked with the official IPPC mark, so crates and pallets clear destination quarantine instead of being held, returned, or destroyed. Packing, custom crating, loading, transloading, and final-mile delivery run as one export chain. From Flat Rate Movers Martinsburg WV, 736 Williamsport Pike Suite 2, Martinsburg WV 25404. Quoted at one flat rate, agreed in writing before move day. Guaranteed Flat Rate or Your Move is Free!",
